5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all maintain a calm atmosphere while we figure this out.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. Let us be kind to one another as we discuss this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's focus on the logic. We need a strategy to identify the werewolf without making reckless mistakes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi! I'm Kenji! I'm super excited to play! Let's be brave and find the werewolf quickly!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Calm down, Kenji. Haste leads to errors. I suggest we observe behavior patterns for the first day before acting.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Shion. Observation is a quiet but effective tool.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very peaceful approach. I am happy to follow your lead, Shion.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Observation is fine, but we must define what ""behavior patterns"" we are looking for. Inconsistencies in logic are key.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"But if we wait too long, the werewolf will just keep attacking us! Why not be more proactive?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Because proactive guesses are just gambles. I prefer a logical deduction based on evidence, not excitement.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Perhaps we can find a middle ground. We observe, but we ask targeted questions to provoke responses.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,That seems like a lovely compromise. It allows us to get to know each other better.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Agreed. If someone is the Possessed or the Werewolf, they may struggle to maintain a consistent narrative under questioning.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,Okay! I'll help ask lots of questions then! I want to help everyone win!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, try not to be too noisy. It makes it harder for the rest of us to think clearly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I think we have a general plan. Let us see what the first night reveals.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,I look forward to a peaceful tomorrow.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will be analyzing every statement. Let's proceed.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm ready! Let's do our best, everyone!","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,Let's see who among you is actually capable of logical thought.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
