33,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I wonder if anyone has discovered anything interesting during the night.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Good morning to you all. I hope everyone slept well despite the tension.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The Seer should have information now. If they are confident, they might consider revealing themselves, though it's risky.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I've got something! I know for sure that Jonathan is a good guy! He's human!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, that's a bold claim. Are you the Seer, or are you just guessing to feel important?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, that is very kind of you to say, though I'm not sure how you'd know.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is very sweet of Kenji to be so supportive, but we must be careful with our words.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, your claim is useful. If you are not, you are providing a shield for Jonathan, which is suspicious.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I am the Seer! I'm not guessing! Jonathan is definitely human, so we can trust him!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shion,,A Seer who reveals themselves immediately is either very brave or very desperate. It seems inefficient.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I find it interesting that Kenji is so eager to protect me. It creates a strange dynamic.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,Let us not be too harsh on Kenji. He only wishes to help us find the truth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, who did you divine? You said Jonathan, but did you find any other clues?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I only checked Jonathan last night! But since he's human, we should look at the others now! Let's vote someone out!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your eagerness to execute someone without further evidence is exactly the behavior of a werewolf trying to stir chaos.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Shion makes a valid point. Kenji's energy is a bit overwhelming, which could be a mask.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I don't want anyone to be sad, but perhaps we should listen to Shion's caution.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"Kenji's claim is too simple. He is pushing for a vote too quickly. Logically, the werewolf wants to eliminate humans fast.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm not a werewolf! I'm just trying to be helpful! Why is everyone doubting me just because I'm excited?!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Emotion is a poor substitute for evidence, Kenji. Your lack of composure makes you the most logical target.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
