65,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a shame about Kenji. He was very energetic. I wonder if we made a mistake.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Poor Kenji. I hope he is not too upset. It is very sad to lose a friend this way.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Shion,,"A necessary sacrifice for the sake of logic. Now, we have lost the ""Seer"" if Kenji was telling the truth.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Kenji was the Seer, we are now blind. If he was the werewolf, we are safer.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Shizue,,I hope we are safer. I just want us all to get along and find a way home.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, you seem very contemplative. Are you feeling guilty, or are you calculating your next move?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am simply reflecting on the nature of trust. It is a fragile thing in a game like this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Trust is indeed fragile, but I believe in the goodness of people.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Shion,,Goodness is a luxury we cannot afford. We have three people left. One of us is likely the werewolf.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"If Shion is so sure of their logic, perhaps Shion is the one manipulating us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
